sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client Application
    participant Gateway as API Gateway / Backend
    participant Store as Idempotency Store (Redis/DB)
    participant Core as Payment Engine / Core Service

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/payments (Headers: Idempotency-Key: "uuid-9876")
    Gateway->>Store: SET key:uuid-9876 "IN_PROGRESS" NX EX 120
    alt Key already exists with state COMPLETED
        Store-->>Gateway: Key exists (Cached Response Payload)
        Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK (Cached Success Response, No Re-execution)
    else Key exists with state IN_PROGRESS
        Store-->>Gateway: Key exists (Currently Processing)
        Gateway-->>Client: 409 Conflict / 425 Too Early ("Request in progress, retry shortly")
    else Key successfully acquired (Lock acquired)
        Store-->>Gateway: OK (Acquisition Success)
        Gateway->>Core: Execute Payment Processing
        Core-->>Gateway: Payment Processed Successfully
        Gateway->>Store: UPDATE key:uuid-9876 SET state="COMPLETED", response=payload, TTL=86400
        Gateway-->>Client: 201 Created (Payment Result)
    end
